[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3566525117","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113027#issuecomment-3566525117","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113027","id":3566525117,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UlNq9","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-22T10:58:04Z","updated_at":"2025-11-22T10:58:04Z","body":"This is not a bug, that method is only called from an extension of `StyleBox` itself, that method is not documented and needs to be clarified, but it is not intended to be called by the normal derived types","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3566525117/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567150437","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113027#issuecomment-3567150437","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113027","id":3567150437,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UnmVl","user":{"login":"Saalvage","id":29021710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MDIxNzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29021710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage","html_url":"https://github.com/Saalvage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-22T23:38:56Z","updated_at":"2025-11-22T23:38:56Z","body":"From a user perspective this is pretty unfortunate, because it forces the creation of a wrapper subtype instead of being able to extend `StyleBoxTexture` directly, but it seems reasonable to avoid the (very frequent) virtual call between languages which aren't necessary in 99% of cases but would otherwise be necessary.\n\nThis behavior should be codified by making all `StyleBox` subtypes `sealed`.\nAnd maybe making the virtual methods `protected` if they aren't intended to be called directly?\n\nIt might also make sense to change the stub implementations to (a. raise an error (probably more desirable, to have a single correct way of doing things) or b. call the non-virtual native methods).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567150437/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567634362","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113027#issuecomment-3567634362","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113027","id":3567634362,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Upce6","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T08:41:50Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T08:41:50Z","body":"> This behavior should be codified by making all `StyleBox` subtypes `sealed`.\n> And maybe making the virtual methods `protected` if they aren't intended to be called directly?\n\nThat's not a thing in GDScript or in the bindings, I'm assuming you're using C# but it still wouldn't work without the actual language bindings supporting it, that's something for a [proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals) as it's not something in the language\n\nBut in this case the direct solution is to document this, but in general this is the case, you also can't use the virtual methods in other resource types, like `Texture2D`\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567634362/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]